# Tome of the Dead side-view background tileset — durable git-diffable source.
# Scene per docs/archive/design/sideview-renderer.md sec 5.1 + colour bands foundations F9.
#   air band   (rows 0-17): black paper / cyan ink  -> features are cyan-on-black
#   ground band(rows 18-23): blue  paper / white ink -> floor texture white-on-blue
# Each tile = header "=== name ink:<c> paper:<c> [bright]" then 8 rows of 8 chars
# ('#' = ink pixel, '.' = paper). Clash-legal by construction (one paper+ink/cell).
# The ATTR_AIR=$05 / ATTR_GROUND=$4F band attrs the engine derives by row; these
# tile attrs match the band so a feature cell stays clash-legal in its band.

=== blank ink:cyan paper:black
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........

